{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reject gravity. Go fast. (But only a little bit.)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo for AVENGE MYSELF, a high-speed physics-based speedrunning FPS inspired by 90's movement shooters and platformers.\u00a0Move like you've never moved before. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a taste of AVENGE MYSELF's gameplay with two stages from the full game and a miniature hub world full of extra events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to grips with gravity-defying physics-based movement with wall riding, loops, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race through stages with flexible level design, letting you find the fastest route on your own terms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hunt for challenging medals requiring skill and planning to earn, then take to the leaderboards and challenge the fastest players in the world (or just your friends!)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Impact Tolerance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488520/c35acfed1bb08b4bb019e55db55b729036b32a59.jpg"},{"name":"A Brazen Disregard for Level Design","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488520/b3cfc2d8fdbb21fe3487844f8c90f068c11a2af3.jpg"},{"name":"Light Up The Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488520/4b7a859d1a2ced57cddc7dac9d197d047e050028.jpg"},{"name":"Interpretive Advance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488520/bdb6884d9b4bdc3198f50573ec5f944af6959cc7.jpg"},{"name":"Toasted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488520/5974fef9d965dbaf11c8bf31758f82bc817a4ec6.jpg"},{"name":"Velocity Manifest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3488520/184397ade763eee0e685ffec9ca40486ac903f9b.jpg"},{"name":"Self Awareness","path":"https://cdn.a